he Cloven Hoof</a> (meloblack)</p><p><a>Wodos &#x2013; </a><a href="https://wodosband.bandcamp.com/album/from-the-grave?ui_context=results_grid&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">From The Grave</a> (shitty thrash)</p><h3 id="yarotz-%E2%80%93-resurgence-hardcore">Yarotz &#x2013; <em>Resurgence</em> (hardcore) </h3>
