<p>Valkyrie&#x2019;s Fire &#x2013; <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TgL5Ig3eRqs&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Out of Darkness</a> (symphonic power metal)</p><p><a>Velveteen Queen &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/VOxX_7eM-0U?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">The Greater Good</a> (rock)</p><p><a>Villagers Of Ioannina City &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/q0b2l62ml1U?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Venceremos</a> (folk metal)</p><p><a>Violent Omen &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/ZdtvdnJrhFw?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Locomotive Of Chaos</a> (progish death metal)</p><p><a>Voodoo Highway &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/864nGG7f3hQ?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">The Satan Inqviesta</a> (stoner rock)</p><p>We Are to Blame &#x2013; <a href="https://wearetoblame.bandcamp.com/track/life-lost-love?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Omega Origin</a> (melodeath)</p><p>The Well &#x2013; <a href="https://thewellaustin.bandcamp.com/album/and-flames-ran-like-living-animals?from=search&amp;search_item_id=1160946052&amp;search_item_type=a&amp;search_match_part=%3F&amp;search_page_id=5756547708&amp;search_page_no=1&amp;search_rank=1&amp;search_sig=cac3075ce199fe1e705e77ab201bd1a7&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">&#x2026;and Flames Ran like Living Animals</a> (psych rock/doom)</p><h3 id="wellnesswellness-mathcore-emoviolence">Wellness - <em>Wellness</em> (mathcore, emoviolence)</h3>
