equiem II: We Will Slaughter the Lambs</a> (groove thrash/death)</p><p><a>Exist Immortal &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/38zHTNbCEQY?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Afterglow</a> (melodic metalcore)</p><p><a>The Fierce &amp; The Dead &#x2013; </a><a href="https://thefierceandthedead.bandcamp.com/album/regional-theatre?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Regional Theatre</a> (post rock, shoegaze)</p><h3 id="filth-%E2%80%93-death-exhibition-death-metal">Filth &#x2013; <em>Death Exhibition</em> (death metal) </h3>
