<p><a>HKSPK &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/zrWwSq6hz_c?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Heimkehr</a> (black/death metal)</p><p>Hrafnablot &#x2013; <a href="https://hrafnablot.bandcamp.com/track/heljarhl-3?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Gu&#xf0;laugar Saga</a> (power metal)</p><p><a>Hubris. &#x2013; </a><a href="https://birdsrobe.bandcamp.com/album/white-shores?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">White Shores</a> (post-prog)</p><p><a>Hunter Omega &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/usvQYbc6ubo?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Lake Of Death</a> (heavy/speed metal)</p><p><a>In Contempt &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/pbLs15Zj2I8?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Hope Is A Dead Language</a> (crusty deathgrind)</p><p><a>Jasmeno &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/niEEKoXtfDM?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Assemblage Of Cinematic Idioms</a> (prog metal)</p><p><a>Jess By The Lake &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/vvKt02qqAY8?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Human</a> (rock)</p><p><a>Killer &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/C2i6pFHccB8?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">The Grand Finale</a> (heavy metal)</p><p>Killing of a Sacred Deer &#x2013; <a href="https://youtu.be/csd6BI-OULI?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com" rel="noreferrer">Encephalic Angels</a> (deathcore)</p><p>Knivad &#x2013; <a href="https://suiciderecordsswe.bandcamp.com/album/lilla-vackra-m-nniska?from=search&amp;search_item_id=2153197061&amp;search_item_type=a&amp;search_match_part=%3F&amp;search_page_id=5734362132&amp;search_page_no=1&amp;search_rank=1&amp;search_sig=7e95490c3ac2fd98057512a0ab44eaa6&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Lilla vackra m&#xe4;nniska</a> (meloblack)</p><p>L&#xfd;sis &#x2013; <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jCtd77w_Jl4&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">At the Edge of Existence</a> (djentcore)</p><p><a>The Medea Project &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/ITcsJs3QE9w?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Kharon: Forbearance</a> (black doom)</p><p><a>The Meffs &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/7PcYRAR_T6c?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Business</a> (nu sludge)</p><p><a>Megaton Communion &#x2013; </a><a href="https://megatoncommunion2.bandcamp.com/album/three-of-cups-full-album?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Three Of Cups</a> (stoner rock/doom)</p><p><a>Mother Of Millions &#x2013; </a><a href="https://vicisolumrecords.bandcamp.com/album/t?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">T</a> (post prog)</p><p>MP &#x2013; <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LG3LsWMmJ_0&amp;list=RDLG3LsWMmJ_0&amp;index=1&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Reborn</a> (heavy metal)</p><p><a>Neolith &#x2013; </a><a href="https://deformeathing.bandcamp.com/album/inbir?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Inbir</a> (death metal)</p><p>Nervochaos &#x2013; <a href="https://nervochaosblacklion.bandcamp.com/album/chaosmongers?from=search&amp;search_item_id=4071196409&amp;search_item_type=a&amp;search_match_part=%3F&amp;search_page_id=5734362212&amp;search_page_no=1&amp;search_rank=1&amp;search_sig=335041d9a4f02d605c5f362d73e241ec&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Chaosmongers</a> (death metal)</p><p>Noct&#xe1;mbulo &#x2013; <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D0Ehh19U5mI&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Enigm&#xe1;tica Incisi&#xf3;n Del Umbral Interno</a> (melodeath)</p><p><a>Offernat &#x2013; </a><a href="https://offernat.bandcamp.com/album/the-ecstasy-of-death?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">The Ecstasy Of Death</a> (progressive death metal)</p><p>P&#xe2;enil Era &#x2013; <a href="https://paenil-era.bandcamp.com/album/a-wilting-fountain?from=search&amp;search_item_id=2213915968&amp;search_item_type=a&amp;search_match_part=%3F&amp;search_page_id=5734362084&amp;search_page_no=1&amp;search_rank=1&amp;search_sig=d50f311f54132eda4c7bc48586a243bc&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">A Wilting Fountain</a> (post/melo black)</p><h3 id="raphael-weinroth-browne-%E2%80%93-empyrean-cello-prog">Raphael Weinroth-Browne &#x2013; <em>Empyrean</em> (cello prog) </h3>
