<p>Scene Queen &#x2013; <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8UAneXfkZwU&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com" rel="noreferrer">Metalicious</a> (y tho?)</p><p><a>Shrineburner &#x2013; </a><a href="https://shrineburner.bandcamp.com/album/hymns-of-despair?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Hymns Of Despair</a> (sludge doom)</p><p>Sistematic Coprophagia &#x2013; <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L3ovr7ff3-o&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Mausoleum of Consumption</a> (brutal/tech death)</p><p>Slime Dimension &#x2013; <a href="https://slimedimension.bandcamp.com/album/slime-dimension?from=search&amp;search_item_id=553589916&amp;search_item_type=a&amp;search_match_part=%3F&amp;search_page_id=5734362343&amp;search_page_no=1&amp;search_rank=1&amp;search_sig=993bd25aa4d44aac553a367288480099&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Slime Dimension</a> (death metal, melodeath)</p><p><a>Slug Comparison &#x2013; </a><a href="https://slugcomparison.bandcamp.com/album/a-battle-to-the-end-fought-on-the-edge-of-a-knife?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Cold In Cold Out</a> (rock)</p><p><a>Sn&#x11b;&#x165; &#x2013; </a><a href="https://darkdescentrecords.bandcamp.com/album/v-ba-in-ch-v-dom?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">V ba&#x17e;in&#xe1;ch v&#x11b;dom&#xed;</a> (death metal)</p><p>Space Chaser &#x2013; <a href="https://spacechaser.bandcamp.com/album/razorblade-bay?from=search&amp;search_item_id=3783609346&amp;search_item_type=a&amp;search_match_part=%3F&amp;search_page_id=5734362184&amp;search_page_no=1&amp;search_rank=1&amp;search_sig=c0d369cb8a2be9e61b467efcfcabb679&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Razorblade Bay</a> (thrash)</p><p><a>Spacechaser &#x2013; </a><a href="https://spacechaser.bandcamp.com/album/razorblade-bay-2?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Razorblade Bay</a> (thrash)</p><p><a>Sweet Electric &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/LKCu5_0AwNE?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Something Something Disco</a> (rock)</p><p>Til the End &#x2013; <a href="https://tiltheendlfr.bandcamp.com/album/til-the-end?from=search&amp;search_item_id=70080321&amp;search_item_type=a&amp;search_match_part=%3F&amp;search_page_id=5734362764&amp;search_page_no=1&amp;search_rank=1&amp;search_sig=db716ab569f3b503125854ffb938afc2&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Til the End</a> (goth metal, melodeath)</p><p><a>Tygers Of Pan Tang &#x2013; </a><a href="https://tygersofpantang.bandcamp.com/album/electrifyed?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Electrifyed</a> (heavy metal, hard rock)</p><p>Vingulmork &#x2013; <a href="https://vingulmork.crimerecords.no/album/barmhjertighetens-fallitt?from=search&amp;search_item_id=406628281&amp;search_item_type=a&amp;search_match_part=%3F&amp;search_page_id=5734362554&amp;search_page_no=1&amp;search_rank=1&amp;search_sig=55f178168469a7c9ab8c758d58e48e6d&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Barmhjertighetens fallitt</a> (meloblack)</p><p><a>Vulgar Mephitis &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/jRTMYyMFMKI?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">From Dust</a> (brutal death metal)</p><p>V&#xfb;lom &#x2013; <a href="https://vulom.bandcamp.com/track/longing?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Love&#x2019;s Lament</a> (meloblack)</p><h3 id="whispered-%E2%80%93-honorbound-melodeath-folk-metal">Whispered &#x2013; <em>Honorbound</em> (melodeath, folk metal) </h3><figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"><iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/j4p1s1oAHoI?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen title="WHISPERED - HONORBOUND (OFFICIAL ALBUM TRAILER)"></iframe></figure><h3 id="wrong-man-%E2%80%93-heres-that-feeling-post-hardcore">Wrong Man &#x2013; <em>Here&apos;s That Feeling</em> (post-hardcore)</h3>
